1
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:48,910
[Genius Girlfriend]

2
00:01:49,250 --> 00:01:51,870
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:55,210 --> 00:01:58,700
[Five years later]

4
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:02,910
[2018]

5
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:11,020
Hello.

6
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,930
Please check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.

7
00:02:12,930 --> 00:02:14,060
Explore green,
low-carbon mode of transportation.

8
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:15,500
Just scan this code.

9
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,180
Hello.
Please check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.

10
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:18,410
Explore green,
low-carbon mode of transportation.

11
00:02:18,410 --> 00:02:21,370
-Check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.
-Duan Qiyan has transformed

12
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:23,840
from Duan to Mr. Duan.

13
00:02:25,210 --> 00:02:26,210
In college,

14
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:27,690
he kept sending us

15
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:30,900
the video clip of him
winning the championship

16
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:33,520
in the college venture competition with a huge lead.

17
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,470
In the video,

18
00:02:34,579 --> 00:02:37,130
Duan Qiyan talks confidently
about the bike-sharing project

19
00:02:37,130 --> 00:02:39,300
called Qilewuqiong,

20
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,120
describing the blueprint for solving

21
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,560
the city's last-mile travel problem.

22
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:48,500
Check out Qilewuqiong Bike-sharing.

23
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:50,960
You say this promoter
doesn't look like him?

24
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,840
Because that's not him.

25
00:02:56,530 --> 00:02:57,860
He's the one next to him.

26
00:03:02,090 --> 00:03:04,500
Mr. Duan, they won't take the flyers.

27
00:03:05,090 --> 00:03:06,500
How many times have I told you?

28
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:08,020
I'm not Mr. Duan right now.

29
00:03:08,090 --> 00:03:09,250
I'm Qiqi—

30
00:03:09,690 --> 00:03:11,970
Qiqi from Qilewuqiong.

31
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,320
Hey, Handsome.

32
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:16,000
I can tell you're a sporty boy
at a glance.

33
00:03:16,230 --> 00:03:18,290
Do you usually like riding bicycles?

34
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,810
Look at these bikes, aren't they cool?

35
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:21,870
If you think so,

36
00:03:21,870 --> 00:03:24,360
hurry up and ask your parents
to scan the code for you.

37
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,960
I will give you a little gift.

38
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,710
Baby, what's going on?

39
00:03:31,310 --> 00:03:32,520
Mom, scan the code.

40
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,500
You must still remember Tang Tingting.

41
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,560
Back then, she was almost scammed
while chasing her idol.

42
00:03:42,470 --> 00:03:45,230
[Star Shine Media]

43
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:44,060
A few of us friends

44
00:03:44,060 --> 00:03:45,650
helped her get back at them.

45
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:48,700
[Star Shine Media reading shelf]

46
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:49,840
Although Duan Qiyan always mocked her
for being bad at studying,

47
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,370
think about it—
how bad can the worst student

48
00:03:51,370 --> 00:03:53,870
in the province's best high school's
experimental class

49
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:55,130
really be?

50
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:13,930
[Star Shine Media]

51
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,030
She was admitted to Zhendan University

52
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:12,150
to study media.

53
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:15,150
Upon graduation,
she decided to put into practice

54
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:17,810
what it would be like
to turn her hobby into a job.

55
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,769
Sure enough,

56
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,690
it's not great.

57
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:30,970
Mr. Wang,
I'll take up 5 more minutes of your time.

58
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,750
Our Su Mo is really good.

59
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:35,480
Whether it's singing, dancing, or sports—

60
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,360
he is proficient in all kinds of talents.

61
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,070
And he can endure a lot of hardship.

62
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:40,040
During his filming last time,

63
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:42,100
his leg was fractured from wire work.

64
00:04:42,190 --> 00:04:45,240
He continued to film
the dialogue scenes with a cast on.

65
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,720
All our upcoming roles

66
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:48,400
require a more mature look.

67
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,830
Your Su...

68
00:04:49,950 --> 00:04:51,010
That's no problem.

69
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,630
Aren't actors
supposed to shape their roles?

70
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:55,680
How can every role be custom-made?

71
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:59,120
I think as long as he understands
the character well,

72
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,800
and with the makeup and styling,

73
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,830
looking 5 to 6 years older
is definitely not a problem.

74
00:05:02,830 --> 00:05:04,800
He is indeed not bad.

75
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:06,630
But for the upcoming roles,

76
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:08,690
Mr. Zheng has almost finalized them.

77
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,040
Let's work together

78
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,840
next time when there's a chance.

79
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,510
I...

80
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,210
Director Li?

81
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,120
You've reached the second basement level?

82
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,430
Okay, I'll come pick you up right away.

83
00:05:21,430 --> 00:05:22,160
All right.

84
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,190
Mr. Wang...

85
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:24,430
Tang, please stay.

86
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,560
No need to see me off.

87
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:32,680
Our next step

88
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,390
is to optimize our system architecture.

89
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:35,310
We will use Java's

90
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:35,980
Spring Boot

91
00:05:35,980 --> 00:05:37,510
framework to restructure the backend

92
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:39,159
to ensure an increase in operational
and maintenance efficiency.

93
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:41,390
We have also independently developed
an intelligent monitoring system

94
00:05:41,390 --> 00:05:43,630
to better monitor
the status of our vehicles.

95
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:45,690
Mr. Liu, won't you take another look?

96
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,270
Mr. Liu!

97
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,480
Well...

98
00:06:07,870 --> 00:06:09,270
That was an investor just now.

99
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:09,950
He

100
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,800
insisted on investing in our project.

101
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,870
But to be honest,

102
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,800
we don't usually consider

103
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,560
small fund firms like them.

104
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,870
What's up?

105
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:21,560
Agent Tang,

106
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,940
you're here talking business today too?

107
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:24,800
Yes.

108
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:27,360
Our Su Mo is very popular now.

109
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,760
Several big projects are fighting for him.

110
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,750
I'm here to reject Mr. Wang.

111
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:35,159
I can't even schedule all his projects.

112
00:06:35,159 --> 00:06:37,220
I'm just afraid of offending people.

113
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:39,130
I'm going to be honest—

114
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:41,440
this Su Mo isn't even as handsome as me.

115
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:42,630
With so many big stars

116
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:44,000
in your company,

117
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,530
why insist on managing him?

118
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,720
What do you know?

119
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:49,480
Our Su Mo is a future top star.

120
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,600
Mind your own business.

121
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:53,360
I tried your shared bike last time,

122
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,630
it felt like riding a spin bike.

123
00:06:54,630 --> 00:06:55,830
It was so exhausting.

124
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,260
Do something about it.

125
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:00,430
Okay, I got it.

126
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:06,070
Then...

127
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:09,040
Good... bye?

128
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,480
Bye-bye.

129
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,420
All right then.

130
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:16,160
Well,

131
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:17,630
bye-bye.

132
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,430
Bye.

133
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:36,760
[Lin Zhixia]

134
00:07:39,070 --> 00:07:41,270
Shen Fuxuan went to study abroad alone.

135
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:43,360
Many mornings,

136
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,300
I would see Shen Fuxuan's Moments.

137
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,920
In the first few months,

138
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,920
there were many likes and comments.

139
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:53,110
Later, there were fewer and fewer.

140
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:55,420
Everyone is busy.

141
00:07:56,570 --> 00:07:58,570
I was busy with my doctoral courses,

142
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:00,580
and he was busy with his internship.

143
00:08:01,010 --> 00:08:03,310
The rainy nights
and moon of a foreign land

144
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:05,040
separated us from Shen Fuxuan.

145
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:15,820
Jin Baihui is still the same,

146
00:08:16,450 --> 00:08:17,380
never slacking.

147
00:08:18,570 --> 00:08:21,230
She gave up
the early admission to other schools

148
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,810
and entered Qingbei University's

149
00:08:22,810 --> 00:08:25,870
Information Engineering Department
based on her college entrance exam result.

150
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:28,830
Then she continued to study every day
without fail.

151
00:08:30,250 --> 00:08:32,080
She's in her second year
of grad school this year.

152
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:35,360
It's said she's already studying
for her PhD exams.

153
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,840
She really is the Jin Baihui
who can stir up a storm

154
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:41,130
wherever she goes.

155
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:02,030
Have you familiarized yourself
with the topic presentation

156
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:03,390
you're giving in a few days?

157
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:04,030
Yes.

158
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,600
I can present it anytime.

159
00:09:10,390 --> 00:09:12,440
Electronic devices
are highly affordable nowadays.

160
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,200
If you like this kind of digital watch,

161
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:16,070
why not replace it with a smart band?

162
00:09:16,070 --> 00:09:18,400
It can track your sleep
and heart rate too.

163
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:20,960
It's different.

164
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,170
You have no idea.

165
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:25,030
This watch

166
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,100
used to have stars on its display.

167
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,720
But it's been broken for 2 years.

168
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:32,120
Who would wear a watch
that can't tell time?

169
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:34,510
Me.

170
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:44,720
When Jiang Yubai gave me this watch,

171
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:45,910
he said

172
00:09:46,650 --> 00:09:48,770
he had an identical one.

173
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:54,410
When the two watches
approach each other,

174
00:09:54,700 --> 00:09:56,130
shining stars

175
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:57,870
appear on the watch face.

176
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:05,080
Although mine no longer tells time,

177
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,810
and the owner of the other watch

178
00:10:08,410 --> 00:10:10,270
already vanished into the crowd,

179
00:10:11,290 --> 00:10:13,510
I'm still wearing it,

180
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,930
as if wearing a silent universe

181
00:10:16,910 --> 00:10:18,150
on my wrist.

182
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:21,030
But, Jiang Yubai,

183
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:24,040
we have been
out of contact for 5 years.

184
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:27,600
Where on earth are you?

185
00:10:35,130 --> 00:10:38,270
[Star Shine Media]

186
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,240
Tingting.

187
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,870
I think if we have to
choose one out of four,

188
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,670
we can choose Director Zhang's.

189
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:53,430
It's a rare opportunity.

190
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,550
This one too.

191
00:10:54,870 --> 00:10:56,000
The second male lead

192
00:10:56,630 --> 00:10:57,960
has a lot of screen time.

193
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,320
What are you doing?

194
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,440
Just looking is useless.

195
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,440
Let's play cards.

196
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:17,720
This Ace represents Director Zhang's
fame and resources.

197
00:11:16,420 --> 00:11:17,600
["Against the Wind"
Directed by Zhang Wendi]

198
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:20,150
This second male lead role
has good screen time and exposure—

199
00:11:19,610 --> 00:11:21,330
["Retaliate"
Directed by Sun Yumeng]

200
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,270
let's give it a King.

201
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:22,440
This adaptation is good,

202
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:24,790
but the screen time is slightly less
than the second male lead role—

203
00:11:24,610 --> 00:11:26,330
["One Light"
Directed by Lian Linhao]

204
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,790
I give it a Queen.

205
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,040
I know you don't like this drama,

206
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,180
so let's give it a 3.

207
00:11:29,180 --> 00:11:32,930
["Train to Morning"
Directed by Li Cheng]

208
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:32,790
Suppose our current market
is a card table.

209
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,390
With your status and popularity,

210
00:11:34,390 --> 00:11:36,120
which card do you think you are?

211
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:38,240
I'm developing steadily now...

212
00:11:40,550 --> 00:11:41,480
let's say a Five.

213
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:44,320
I have a bit more experience than you,

214
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,600
so I'll choose a 6.

215
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,860
This rookie director,

216
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,360
let's give him a 7.

217
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:52,120
Now is the time to see our luck.

218
00:11:52,630 --> 00:11:54,360
Shuffle the cards and draw one.

219
00:11:55,610 --> 00:11:56,390
["Against the Wind"] ["Retaliate"]

220
00:11:57,510 --> 00:11:58,770
I shall draw this card.

221
00:12:04,790 --> 00:12:06,510
This Ace seems the biggest

222
00:12:06,510 --> 00:12:07,970
and the most domineering.

223
00:12:08,410 --> 00:12:11,480
["Against the Wind"] ["Retaliate"]

224
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,000
But when a 5 like you

225
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,390
is paired with the Ace,

226
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:13,030
the Ace is the one that stands out,

227
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:13,870
not you.

228
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,150
Same goes for these two scripts.

229
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:17,490
["One Light"] ["Train to Morning"]

230
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,670
As for this 3—

231
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:20,030
while it seems the smallest,

232
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:23,970
["One Light"] ["Train to Morning"]

233
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:21,600
it has a solid script

234
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:23,750
and an imaginative rookie director.

235
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,660
This is the card
you can really combine with.

236
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,080
It's like your own traits,

237
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:32,240
continuous effort,

238
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:35,240
and other opportunities
you might encounter in the future—

239
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,900
these often combine together

240
00:12:37,030 --> 00:12:38,960
to create greater possibilities.

241
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:41,000
Its potential

242
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:44,000
is often greater than this single Ace.

243
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,660
So which one do you choose now?

244
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:52,750
I understand.

245
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,640
I don't want to play a single Ace.

246
00:12:56,030 --> 00:12:57,430
I want to form a straight.

247
00:12:58,150 --> 00:12:59,150
I choose this 3.

248
00:13:00,870 --> 00:13:02,030
After joining the crew,

249
00:13:02,030 --> 00:13:03,440
work harder.

250
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,080
It will be fine.

251
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,080
Don't worry.

252
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:07,110
When have I ever let you down?

253
00:13:17,870 --> 00:13:18,790
Zhixia.

254
00:13:19,670 --> 00:13:21,270
I have something to tell you.

255
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:25,630
What's wrong, Shuwen?

256
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:28,440
Zhixia, can I ask you a favor?

257
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:29,200
What is it?

258
00:13:31,510 --> 00:13:33,910
You know I've deferred my graduation
for 2 years.

259
00:13:33,910 --> 00:13:35,270
If I defer it again this year,

260
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:37,080
I won't be able to get my master's degree.

261
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:37,870
I heard

262
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:40,800
Tan Qianche's research group
will definitely pass.

263
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,000
I really need this project.

264
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,910
Can you vote for me later?

265
00:13:47,550 --> 00:13:49,280
You're not the only candidate.

266
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,550
Xu Nuo has been following this—

267
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:51,360
I know.

268
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:54,440
But there's only one spot left
in the research group.

269
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,200
If I can't get into this group,

270
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,360
I'll definitely be doomed again this year.

271
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:01,360
Zhixia, please do me this favor.

272
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,580
Not being able to graduate

273
00:14:04,750 --> 00:14:06,550
is a dead end.

274
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:07,670
In society,

275
00:14:07,670 --> 00:14:09,480
it's basically murder.

276
00:14:10,780 --> 00:14:13,000
I'm begging you.

277
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:14,390
Please.

278
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,080
In the upcoming review,

279
00:14:17,310 --> 00:14:19,790
the key is not
who needs this position more,

280
00:14:20,270 --> 00:14:22,120
but who can better represent our group's

281
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,630
future output and image.

282
00:14:23,910 --> 00:14:25,720
Everyone needs to weigh this carefully.

283
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,750
We must differentiate the big picture

284
00:14:27,750 --> 00:14:29,150
from personal feelings.

285
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:31,910
Especially Ms. Lin.

286
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:34,910
Your opinion always carries
a lot of weight,

287
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:36,440
and you see things clearly.

288
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:37,480
Your vote

289
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:39,240
determines the project's academic purity

290
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,370
and how far it can go.

291
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:41,910
I believe

292
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:44,080
you will certainly make
the most objective choice

293
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:47,000
that is most in line with the long-term
interests of the research group.

294
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:47,750
Right?

295
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:56,550
Zhixia.

296
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,870
I'll see to it.

297
00:14:58,510 --> 00:14:59,440
Thank you.

298
00:14:59,910 --> 00:15:00,720
Thanks.

299
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:02,720
I'll make it up to you.

300
00:15:08,110 --> 00:15:10,300
Qianche's research group
is still short of one person.

301
00:15:10,300 --> 00:15:12,870
[Tan Qianche Research Group Candidate
Voting Meeting]

302
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:12,030
As usual, we will

303
00:15:12,030 --> 00:15:13,670
select one from the graduate students

304
00:15:13,670 --> 00:15:14,730
in the department.

305
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:17,790
Zhixia,

306
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:20,240
Zheng, Qin,

307
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:22,000
Hou, and Xiong.

308
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:25,440
The five of you have
no conflict of interest with this project.

309
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:26,360
You will vote.

310
00:15:26,310 --> 00:15:30,170
[Tan Qianche Research Group Candidate
Voting Meeting]

311
00:15:27,390 --> 00:15:30,240
The candidates are Yang Shuwen and Xu Nuo.

312
00:15:30,670 --> 00:15:31,390
You are all friends,

313
00:15:31,390 --> 00:15:32,600
don't be constrained.

314
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:34,060
Vote for whoever you want.

315
00:15:34,630 --> 00:15:35,360
Let's begin.

316
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,370
Then... Then I'll go first.

317
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:46,600
I vote

318
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:48,480
for Yang Shuwen.

319
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:52,240
I vote for Xu Nuo.

320
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,910
I vote for Xu Nuo.

321
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,580
I vote for Yang Shuwen.

322
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,360
It's a two-to-two tie.

323
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:18,650
It seems everyone has thought it through.

324
00:16:19,390 --> 00:16:20,870
This most crucial vote,

325
00:16:21,510 --> 00:16:22,320
Zhixia,

326
00:16:23,270 --> 00:16:24,150
is up to you.

327
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:40,560
I vote for Xu Nuo.

328
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:53,200
Let me introduce.

329
00:16:53,890 --> 00:16:54,700
These two

330
00:16:54,700 --> 00:16:56,500
are Jin Baihui's parents,

331
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:58,130
Jin Quan and Zhang Li.

332
00:16:58,580 --> 00:17:00,130
We are old friends.

333
00:17:00,130 --> 00:17:00,770
Yes.

334
00:17:01,130 --> 00:17:03,010
This is Li Zhe's mother.

335
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:04,250
Her husband

336
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:06,050
is the president
of the Huacheng Chamber of Commerce.

337
00:17:06,050 --> 00:17:07,500
She's here today to...

338
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:10,609
Let me say it.

339
00:17:11,290 --> 00:17:12,500
My son, Li Zhe,

340
00:17:12,609 --> 00:17:15,140
is a classmate
of your daughter, Jin Baihui.

341
00:17:15,660 --> 00:17:17,980
Jin Baihui is studying
Information Engineering,

342
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:19,910
and Li Zhe is studying philosophy.

343
00:17:20,900 --> 00:17:22,010
Philosophy.

344
00:17:23,609 --> 00:17:25,740
Baihui is really excellent.

345
00:17:26,089 --> 00:17:28,490
My son has seen her
at school several times.

346
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:30,330
He always tells me when he gets home

347
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:31,500
about how he has never

348
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:34,250
seen a girl
with such clear logical thinking,

349
00:17:34,420 --> 00:17:35,880
such a clean temperament,

350
00:17:36,570 --> 00:17:38,050
and so beautiful.

351
00:17:41,050 --> 00:17:42,250
Young people,

352
00:17:42,740 --> 00:17:45,090
they just want to make friends.

353
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:50,500
Our Baihui

354
00:17:50,570 --> 00:17:52,770
just loves to read and study.

355
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:54,460
She's not as good as you say.

356
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:55,770
You really flatter her.

357
00:17:55,770 --> 00:17:56,500
Yes.

358
00:17:56,700 --> 00:17:59,090
It's because you two raised her well.

359
00:17:59,530 --> 00:18:00,570
Mrs. Li,

360
00:18:00,810 --> 00:18:03,380
the Jins are from a scholarly family.

361
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:05,500
They've been strict
with Baihui since she was little.

362
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,290
I've seen it all.

363
00:18:07,290 --> 00:18:07,900
Yes.

364
00:18:07,900 --> 00:18:10,700
Then Li Zhe must be very excellent too.

365
00:18:10,770 --> 00:18:12,180
When we see Baihui,

366
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:13,900
we will definitely
have a good talk with her.

367
00:18:13,900 --> 00:18:14,660
Yes.

368
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:15,740
Exactly.

369
00:18:15,940 --> 00:18:17,010
I came today

370
00:18:17,180 --> 00:18:18,740
just for this.

371
00:18:19,810 --> 00:18:20,610
I've also spoken

372
00:18:20,610 --> 00:18:22,330
to my husband about this.

373
00:18:22,570 --> 00:18:23,660
He said

374
00:18:23,810 --> 00:18:26,330
young people should learn from each other

375
00:18:26,330 --> 00:18:27,930
and make progress together.

376
00:18:28,010 --> 00:18:29,460
As parents,

377
00:18:30,010 --> 00:18:33,210
we should try our best
to create some conditions for them.

378
00:18:36,140 --> 00:18:37,250
Exactly.

379
00:18:37,330 --> 00:18:38,850
As parents,

380
00:18:38,850 --> 00:18:40,570
we have to think ahead about everything

381
00:18:40,570 --> 00:18:42,100
and look at the big picture.

382
00:18:43,330 --> 00:18:45,740
How about we see if Baihui
is busy right now

383
00:18:45,740 --> 00:18:47,270
and make a video call to her?

384
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:51,140
We won't be disturbing her study, will we?

385
00:18:51,140 --> 00:18:52,220
-No.
-It's okay.

386
00:18:52,220 --> 00:18:53,500
We always call her anyway.

387
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:55,360
Girls need to be raised strictly.

388
00:18:55,850 --> 00:18:57,420
Right, let's call her.

389
00:18:57,530 --> 00:18:59,220
Show Baihui some concern.

390
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:08,850
Dad, what's wrong?

391
00:19:08,850 --> 00:19:10,050
I'm busy running data.

392
00:19:10,050 --> 00:19:10,850
It's nothing.

393
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:13,630
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

394
00:19:11,090 --> 00:19:11,940
Have you eaten?

395
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:13,740
Look at you, you've lost weight recently.

396
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:14,530
I've told you,

397
00:19:14,530 --> 00:19:16,140
to eat well and sleep well.

398
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,740
Don't stay up late, you know?

399
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:19,740
I forgot. I'll eat in a bit.

400
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:21,610
Baihui, listen to your dad.

401
00:19:20,410 --> 00:19:22,550
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

402
00:19:21,610 --> 00:19:22,610
Your dad is right.

403
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:24,330
Health is the capital of the revolution.

404
00:19:24,330 --> 00:19:25,610
You must eat your meals.

405
00:19:25,610 --> 00:19:26,500
Do you hear me?

406
00:19:26,410 --> 00:19:29,040
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

407
00:19:27,530 --> 00:19:28,530
Girls

408
00:19:28,530 --> 00:19:29,930
shouldn't work too hard.

409
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:31,420
Okay.

410
00:19:31,980 --> 00:19:33,180
By the way, look.

411
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:36,290
Look, who's this?

412
00:19:34,660 --> 00:19:36,240
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

413
00:19:36,290 --> 00:19:37,850
Ms. Chen. Do you remember her?

414
00:19:37,850 --> 00:19:40,250
Baihui, I miss you.

415
00:19:40,420 --> 00:19:41,500
This lady over here

416
00:19:41,530 --> 00:19:43,900
is your classmate Li Zhe's mother.

417
00:19:43,900 --> 00:19:44,770
Say hello.

418
00:19:44,770 --> 00:19:45,610
Hello.

419
00:19:46,770 --> 00:19:47,810
Hi, Ms. Li.

420
00:19:48,420 --> 00:19:50,330
Sorry, I've been busy
with school recently,

421
00:19:50,330 --> 00:19:52,180
and I haven't had time to visit you.

422
00:19:52,180 --> 00:19:52,940
I apologize.

423
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:54,610
It's okay, it's okay.

424
00:19:54,850 --> 00:19:56,530
Okay, I know you're busy.

425
00:19:56,530 --> 00:19:57,590
I know you're busy.

426
00:19:58,090 --> 00:19:59,500
I won't disturb your studies.

427
00:19:59,500 --> 00:20:01,570
It's fine, just call us more often.

428
00:19:59,530 --> 00:20:03,090
[Microphone] [Speaker] [Camera]

429
00:20:01,900 --> 00:20:03,190
Make sure you eat your meals.

430
00:20:03,190 --> 00:20:04,050
We're hanging up now.

431
00:20:04,050 --> 00:20:05,010
Okay, bye-bye.

432
00:20:19,660 --> 00:20:20,460
Zhixia.

433
00:20:21,770 --> 00:20:23,660
Don't you think the vote just now
was too coincidental?

434
00:20:23,660 --> 00:20:29,990
[Qingbei University]
[Quantum Bits and Computing]

435
00:20:26,810 --> 00:20:29,380
Statistically,
low-probability events do happen.

436
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:31,850
No, they deliberately made it a tie

437
00:20:31,850 --> 00:20:33,380
to force you to take a stand.

438
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:37,090
I know.

439
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:46,620
[Qingbei University]
[Quantum Bits and Computing]

440
00:20:40,290 --> 00:20:41,980
The way they voted just now,

441
00:20:42,330 --> 00:20:44,260
looked like they had rehearsed it.

442
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:47,570
It must have been
Tan Qianche's instruction.

443
00:20:47,570 --> 00:20:49,830
Then why didn't you vote for Yang Shuwen?

444
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:54,330
I didn't vote for Xu Nuo
just to break the tie,

445
00:20:55,250 --> 00:20:58,180
but because she is really suitable
for this project.

446
00:20:58,700 --> 00:21:00,700
I've helped revise
everyone's master's thesis

447
00:21:00,700 --> 00:21:01,940
in our department.

448
00:21:02,940 --> 00:21:05,250
I know Shuwen
needs this project to graduate,

449
00:21:05,250 --> 00:21:07,570
and I know Tan Qianche
is forcing me to take a stand.

450
00:21:07,570 --> 00:21:09,900
No matter who I vote for,
they will hate me.

451
00:21:10,220 --> 00:21:11,250
I just think

452
00:21:12,610 --> 00:21:14,090
scientific research is not about politics

453
00:21:14,090 --> 00:21:15,140
or favors.

454
00:21:16,210 --> 00:21:17,770
Academics cannot lie.

455
00:21:22,770 --> 00:21:25,300
Ms. Lin Zhixia,
I have something to say to you.

456
00:21:30,530 --> 00:21:31,420
Do you know

457
00:21:31,420 --> 00:21:33,010
that your vote was the deciding one?

458
00:21:33,010 --> 00:21:33,900
Because of you,

459
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:36,030
I might really not graduate this year.

460
00:21:36,090 --> 00:21:36,900
Lin Zhixia,

461
00:21:37,050 --> 00:21:38,740
why are you doing this to me?

462
00:21:39,090 --> 00:21:41,330
Shuwen, you should know very well

463
00:21:41,610 --> 00:21:42,850
that your research direction

464
00:21:42,850 --> 00:21:45,180
does not align with Tan Qianche's project.

465
00:21:45,180 --> 00:21:46,500
Even if you do join,

466
00:21:46,740 --> 00:21:49,140
this project won't give you any advantage.

467
00:21:49,180 --> 00:21:50,940
You will just be a marginal figure.

468
00:21:50,940 --> 00:21:52,010
I don't care.

469
00:21:52,050 --> 00:21:54,310
As long as you vote for me,
I can graduate.

470
00:21:54,570 --> 00:21:55,570
What about Xu Nuo?

471
00:21:55,940 --> 00:21:57,740
She's also in her second year
of her master's program.

472
00:21:57,740 --> 00:21:58,810
For the past 2 years,

473
00:21:58,810 --> 00:22:00,850
she has spent all her time
on this research topic.

474
00:22:00,850 --> 00:22:02,660
She worked uncredited for 2 years.

475
00:22:02,660 --> 00:22:04,390
Shouldn't she be in this group?

476
00:22:04,460 --> 00:22:06,120
Now you are reasoning with me.

477
00:22:06,290 --> 00:22:08,240
Aren't there people
in the research group too?

478
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:10,170
People should consider feelings.

479
00:22:10,330 --> 00:22:11,610
I help you, you help me.

480
00:22:11,630 --> 00:22:13,360
What has Xu Nuo helped you with?

481
00:22:13,740 --> 00:22:14,900
Last year, for your thesis,

482
00:22:14,900 --> 00:22:16,940
I did my best to help you run the data.

483
00:22:17,010 --> 00:22:18,660
Why can't you help me?

484
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:19,850
It's exactly because you helped me,

485
00:22:19,850 --> 00:22:21,180
I couldn't vote for you.

486
00:22:21,740 --> 00:22:23,660
The sub-project Tan Qianche gave you

487
00:22:23,660 --> 00:22:25,320
is just scraps from his paper.

488
00:22:25,460 --> 00:22:26,740
While Xu Nuo's model

489
00:22:26,850 --> 00:22:29,710
is the real direction
that can aim for top journals.

490
00:22:30,180 --> 00:22:31,180
If I voted for you,

491
00:22:31,570 --> 00:22:33,830
it would be pushing you
into a pit of fire.

492
00:22:34,050 --> 00:22:35,090
You can graduate,

493
00:22:35,330 --> 00:22:36,700
but as long as you stay in this industry,

494
00:22:36,700 --> 00:22:37,700
you'll find that

495
00:22:37,980 --> 00:22:40,180
except for the empty title
of Tan Qianche's research group,

496
00:22:40,180 --> 00:22:41,180
you have nothing.

497
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:44,610
Shuwen, I should help you,

498
00:22:45,290 --> 00:22:46,420
but not by giving you a ticket

499
00:22:46,420 --> 00:22:48,010
to a dead end.

500
00:22:48,700 --> 00:22:50,900
Instead, while there's still time,
I should tell you

501
00:22:50,900 --> 00:22:52,300
to take a different path.

502
00:22:52,660 --> 00:22:53,530
A different path?

503
00:22:53,530 --> 00:22:54,740
What path?

504
00:22:55,010 --> 00:22:56,500
If I can't join this group,
I can't graduate.

505
00:22:56,500 --> 00:22:57,660
Do I have any other path I can take?

506
00:22:57,660 --> 00:22:59,700
I'll figure something out. I promise.

507
00:22:59,700 --> 00:23:01,700
You... stop saying these useless things.

508
00:23:01,700 --> 00:23:03,220
Meeting a heartless person like you

509
00:23:03,220 --> 00:23:05,080
who bites the hand that feeds you,

510
00:23:05,090 --> 00:23:06,420
I count myself unlucky.

511
00:23:13,250 --> 00:23:15,160
Growing up is just so frustrating.

512
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:18,180
[Find what's new around you]
[Jiang Yubai]

513
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:19,680
[Jiang Yubai appears in the alumni directory
of Nanhai No. 1 High School]

514
00:23:21,550 --> 00:23:24,440
"Lin Lin Lin Lin Lin Zhixia."

515
00:23:25,330 --> 00:23:27,350
I announce that from now on,

516
00:23:27,350 --> 00:23:28,510
you are my friend,

517
00:23:28,590 --> 00:23:29,750
my best friend.

518
00:23:30,140 --> 00:23:32,340
"Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai"?

519
00:23:34,050 --> 00:23:35,480
Actually, I've been wanting to ask you.

520
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:37,210
Why did you come back this time?

521
00:23:37,330 --> 00:23:38,030
For you.

522
00:23:40,350 --> 00:23:42,030
This beam of light took 8.6 years

523
00:23:42,030 --> 00:23:43,160
to reach Earth.

524
00:23:44,220 --> 00:23:45,880
That means before we even met,

525
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:47,590
it had already embarked

526
00:23:47,590 --> 00:23:49,010
on the journey to meet us.

527
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:51,760
Duan Qiyan and the others
are my good friends,

528
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:54,220
but you're more like
my binary star partner.

529
00:23:55,070 --> 00:23:58,030
We will advance along different orbits,

530
00:23:59,600 --> 00:24:02,440
but our center will always be the same.

531
00:24:11,290 --> 00:24:15,210
[Jiang Yubai, are you there?]

532
00:24:18,850 --> 00:24:19,580
Jiang Yubai.

533
00:24:20,510 --> 00:24:21,900
Where exactly are you?

534
00:24:30,590 --> 00:24:32,120
Hurry, the defibrillator!

535
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:35,250
Hurry!

536
00:24:35,420 --> 00:24:36,050
Mom!

537
00:25:44,820 --> 00:25:51,170
[Repayment plan for the next 7 months:
437,000]

538
00:26:02,140 --> 00:26:05,340
[Qingbei University]

539
00:26:02,770 --> 00:26:03,550
Have you heard?

540
00:26:03,550 --> 00:26:04,810
Dr. Lin from our university

541
00:26:04,810 --> 00:26:06,410
will give us a sharing today.

542
00:26:06,530 --> 00:26:07,180
Really?

543
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:10,880
I heard she entered our university
through early admission.

544
00:26:12,770 --> 00:26:13,660
Here she comes.

545
00:26:18,690 --> 00:26:20,000
[Qingbei University]

546
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:20,740
Ms. Lin is so pretty.

547
00:26:20,900 --> 00:26:21,920
She really is.

548
00:26:22,480 --> 00:26:23,750
She's not only an overachieving scholar,

549
00:26:23,750 --> 00:26:25,150
but also a gorgeous lady.

550
00:26:26,630 --> 00:26:27,030
[Qingbei University]

551
00:26:27,060 --> 00:26:28,710
[Quantum Bits and Computers]

552
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:32,130
Today I'll be talking about
quantum bits and computers.

553
00:26:32,350 --> 00:26:35,310
A classical computer bit is like a switch—

554
00:26:35,350 --> 00:26:36,480
it's either 0 or 1.

555
00:26:37,090 --> 00:26:38,140
But a quantum bit,

556
00:26:38,140 --> 00:26:39,030
is more like

557
00:26:39,030 --> 00:26:41,390
a spinning top rotating
in two opposite directions simultaneously.

558
00:26:41,390 --> 00:26:44,030
[The superposition state of a quantum bit]

559
00:26:41,740 --> 00:26:42,870
Mathematics proved

560
00:26:43,380 --> 00:26:45,220
that using vectors in a Hilbert space

561
00:26:44,050 --> 00:26:46,530
[The "perfect description" in math]

562
00:26:45,220 --> 00:26:48,750
can perfectly represent
this state of simultaneous rotation.

563
00:27:08,850 --> 00:27:10,260
[Quantum Bits and Computers]

564
00:27:11,380 --> 00:27:12,980
On this ordinary afternoon,

565
00:27:13,580 --> 00:27:15,840
the stars surprisingly showed up again.

566
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:19,090
The slight heat from the dial plate

567
00:27:19,220 --> 00:27:23,050
is the temperature deep in my memory
that never cooled down.

568
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:29,200
You told me that you wouldn't be far away

569
00:27:29,820 --> 00:27:31,820
as long as the stars were sparkling.

570
00:27:32,830 --> 00:27:33,560
Jiang Yubai,

571
00:27:34,480 --> 00:27:36,610
have you always been around?

572
00:27:37,050 --> 00:27:39,440
Did you never leave me?

573
00:27:48,770 --> 00:27:49,570
Master Jiang.

574
00:27:50,380 --> 00:27:52,330
The telescope you left on the mountain,

575
00:27:52,330 --> 00:27:53,930
can it really capture stars?

576
00:27:57,770 --> 00:27:58,700
You're amazing.

577
00:27:59,140 --> 00:28:00,050
You can fix appliances

578
00:28:00,050 --> 00:28:01,090
and do crafts.

579
00:28:02,610 --> 00:28:04,140
You can even capture stars.

580
00:28:04,530 --> 00:28:05,860
You really are a master.

581
00:28:13,570 --> 00:28:15,220
Go back once you get the stuff.

582
00:28:15,220 --> 00:28:16,480
I have something to do.

583
00:28:27,090 --> 00:28:28,350
Master Jiang, then...

584
00:28:28,500 --> 00:28:29,430
I'll be leaving.

585
00:28:36,740 --> 00:28:39,200
Top student,
it's time to pay the money back.

586
00:28:46,590 --> 00:28:48,550
Wow, you can even do this.

587
00:28:49,290 --> 00:28:50,180
Amazing.

588
00:28:59,090 --> 00:28:59,850
Six.

589
00:29:00,570 --> 00:29:01,700
Okay, just right.

590
00:29:02,220 --> 00:29:02,980
I'm leaving.

591
00:29:16,340 --> 00:29:20,480
[Repayment plan for the next 7 months:
437,000]

592
00:29:26,050 --> 00:29:29,430
[Repayment plan for the next 7 months:
437,000]

593
00:29:48,350 --> 00:29:53,350
[Meet Lin Zhixia]

594
00:30:47,380 --> 00:30:51,150
♪ With every breath, the shadows creep ♪

595
00:30:54,350 --> 00:30:57,550
♪ A demon in disguise ♪

596
00:30:58,870 --> 00:31:01,950
♪ Talking the sweetest lies ♪

597
00:31:05,840 --> 00:31:09,580
♪ It tries to drown me in my sleep ♪

598
00:31:10,290 --> 00:31:12,330
"Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai."

599
00:31:12,050 --> 00:31:15,670
♪ Pain comes like a tide ♪

600
00:31:14,810 --> 00:31:16,880
"Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai."

601
00:31:16,730 --> 00:31:21,330
♪ It hurts,
but I'm way too tired to hide ♪

602
00:31:21,980 --> 00:31:26,980
♪ Will you please hold me, help me
walk out of this endless night ♪

603
00:31:27,250 --> 00:31:28,900
♪ I've lost my light and power ♪

604
00:31:28,980 --> 00:31:31,540
♪ Lost my will to fight ♪

605
00:31:31,790 --> 00:31:34,870
♪ Will you stay by my side ♪

606
00:31:35,590 --> 00:31:36,400
Miss.

607
00:31:37,030 --> 00:31:38,670
It's not that I don't want to help you.

608
00:31:38,670 --> 00:31:40,640
The chip in this watch of yours

609
00:31:40,750 --> 00:31:42,440
is different from standard ones.

610
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:44,000
Its code is encrypted.

611
00:31:44,270 --> 00:31:45,070
Even if it's broken,

612
00:31:45,070 --> 00:31:47,510
it's not something
that can be easily fixed.

613
00:31:47,510 --> 00:31:48,400
This firmware

614
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:49,790
has been overwritten so many times

615
00:31:49,790 --> 00:31:51,640
that it has basically reached its limit.

616
00:31:51,640 --> 00:31:52,440
Unless you can find

617
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:54,350
the person who flashed this firmware,

618
00:31:54,350 --> 00:31:55,920
otherwise, if you force it,

619
00:31:56,070 --> 00:31:58,270
it's very likely that this watch
will be completely ruined.

620
00:31:58,270 --> 00:31:59,600
That would be a problem.

621
00:32:00,550 --> 00:32:02,680
Please see if there are any other ways.

622
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:05,130
This watch is very important to me.

623
00:32:05,350 --> 00:32:06,400
I can pay extra.

624
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:07,460
As much as you want.

625
00:32:07,590 --> 00:32:08,990
It's not about the money.

626
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:10,840
Let me put it this way—

627
00:32:11,110 --> 00:32:12,680
this code encryption

628
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:14,750
is like the person who made this watch

629
00:32:14,750 --> 00:32:16,400
put a combination lock on it.

630
00:32:16,550 --> 00:32:17,590
The rest of us

631
00:32:17,590 --> 00:32:19,400
can try to crack the code.

632
00:32:19,590 --> 00:32:21,830
If we're lucky,
we might open it on the first try.

633
00:32:21,830 --> 00:32:23,750
But if we try a few times
and get it wrong,

634
00:32:23,750 --> 00:32:25,200
the lock will protect itself

635
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:26,160
and lock itself down.

636
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:28,020
Then no one will be able to open it.

637
00:32:28,110 --> 00:32:31,030
So this is very risky.

638
00:32:31,030 --> 00:32:33,030
I really don't dare to take this job.

639
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:34,000
I'm sorry.

640
00:32:38,070 --> 00:32:39,440
Sorry to bother you then.

641
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,040
It's okay.

642
00:32:52,750 --> 00:32:53,590
Hey, Miss.

643
00:32:55,270 --> 00:32:56,440
Miss.

644
00:32:56,550 --> 00:32:57,480
My name's Cheng.

645
00:32:58,510 --> 00:32:59,510
Can I help you?

646
00:33:00,350 --> 00:33:02,640
I might have a way to fix that watch.

647
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:05,160
I know a master.

648
00:33:05,720 --> 00:33:07,240
His skills are very advanced.

649
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:09,160
He specializes in fixing weird things.

650
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:12,420
Things that can't be fixed
in these places can't stump him.

651
00:33:15,480 --> 00:33:16,340
How about this?

652
00:33:17,070 --> 00:33:17,880
If it's okay,

653
00:33:18,270 --> 00:33:19,400
