654
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:20,200
I'll take the watch

655
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:21,600
and show it to our master.

656
00:33:21,790 --> 00:33:24,590
If he can't fix it,
I promise to return it exactly as it is.

657
00:33:24,590 --> 00:33:25,990
You have nothing to lose.

658
00:33:27,070 --> 00:33:28,680
But I've asked many places.

659
00:33:29,790 --> 00:33:31,200
This kind of self-encrypted code,

660
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:32,600
if it can't be decrypted,

661
00:33:32,750 --> 00:33:34,070
it's very likely to be damaged.

662
00:33:34,070 --> 00:33:34,880
I know.

663
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:37,320
Our master also does computer decryption.

664
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:39,960
He's really amazing.

665
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,960
Your watch isn't that complicated.

666
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:43,830
Last time he even fixed

667
00:33:44,500 --> 00:33:48,000
