-I'll pay whatever it takes.

672
00:33:55,030 --> 00:33:57,830
All right, come on,
let's add each other on WeChat.

673
00:33:59,790 --> 00:34:01,790
Brother Jiang, this is a big job.

674
00:34:02,110 --> 00:34:04,440
A programmed electronic watch is broken.

675
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:05,590
I took a quick look.

676
00:34:05,790 --> 00:34:07,790
