680
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:15,580
I'm not available this month.

681
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:18,800
The client said

682
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:20,190
as long as it can be fixed,

683
00:34:20,190 --> 00:34:21,449
