684
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:24,800
This watch seemed

685
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:27,080
very important to that lady.

686
00:34:27,800 --> 00:34:28,960
If you can fix it,

687
00:34:29,110 --> 00:34:30,360
