729
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,510
It's really fixed.

730
00:38:50,960 --> 00:38:53,090
I told you our Master Jiang is amazing.

731
00:38:53,110 --> 00:38:54,240
He can fix anything.

732
00:38:54,590 --> 00:38:56,320
