761
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:04,110
Nothing. It's not him.

762
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:08,440
I just remembered.

763
00:41:08,440 --> 00:41:09,920
We have an external job today.

764
00:41:09,920 --> 00:41:11,180
He might have gone out.

765
00:41:12,150 --> 00:41:14,710
But I just heard a noise inside.

766
00:41:15,230 --> 00:41:16,560
You must have misheard.

767
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:17,550
This crappy warehouse

768
00:41:17,550 --> 00:41:19,610
