771
00:41:22,710 --> 00:41:24,150
He won't be back for a while.

772
00:41:24,150 --> 00:41:26,840
Miss Lin, why don't you go back first?

773
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:27,510
No need.

774
00:41:28,510 --> 00:41:30,000
He'll come back, right?

775
00:41:30,320 --> 00:41:31,630
I'll wait for him right here.

776
00:41:31,630 --> 00:41:33,030
I have nothing going on today anyway.

777
00:41:33,030 --> 00:41:33,920
Well...

778
00:41:34,150 --> 00:41:35,230
With his temper,

779
00:41:35,320 --> 00:41:36,360
