780
00:41:36,360 --> 00:41:37,150
It's fine.

781
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:39,660
I'll wait until he comes back.

782
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:40,480
You...

783
00:41:47,490 --> 00:41:49,210
