789
00:41:58,920 --> 00:41:59,710
Thank you.

790
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:11,010
As I stood in front of this door,

791
00:42:13,280 --> 00:42:15,740
I didn't know
if it was Jiang Yubai behind it.

792
00:42:17,550 --> 00:42:20,010
Nor did I know
if Jiang Yubai wanted to see me.

793
00:42:21,650 --> 00:42:22,570
Perhaps,

794
00:42:24,150 --> 00:42:26,400
