00:45:24,650 --> 00:45:30,550
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

826
00:45:30,320 --> 00:45:33,190
I want to be with you forever.

827
00:45:31,190 --> 00:45:35,240
♪ Myself ♪

828
00:45:35,190 --> 00:45:37,190
You will always be my one and only...

829
